    ("h2", "5.5 The working application"),
    ("p", "The figures below are screens from a demonstration account with a sample field near Mandya, Karnataka. They show what a farmer sees and give concrete values that can be traced to the engines of Chapter 4. {fig:s_login} is the sign-in page, which doubles as the sign-up page and the entry to password reset."),
